.*  so that it can be used by a search index.
.*****************************************************************
:HELP name='CHGOBJDA/ALL'.
:IMHELP name=CHGOBJDA.
:IMHELP name='CHGOBJDA/OBJ'.
:IMHELP name='CHGOBJDA/OBJTYPE'.
